---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ru">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Гильдия Durotar — World of Warcraft: Forever</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Гильдия Durotar — русскоязычное сообщество игроков в World of Warcraft: Forever (версия на основе Classic): рейды, подземелья, PvP и открытый набор."
    />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0c0906" />
    <link rel="icon" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}favicon.svg`} type="image/svg+xml" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Гильдия Durotar — World of Warcraft: Forever" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="Русскоязычная гильдия: рейды, подземелья, PvP, открытый набор." />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/West_Mitten_Butte_-_Monument_Valley_Luca_Galuzzi_2007.jpg/1920px-West_Mitten_Butte_-_Monument_Valley_Luca_Galuzzi_2007.jpg" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel+Decorative:wght@700&family=Forum&family=PT+Serif:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&display=swap"
    />

    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: dark;
        --night: #0c0906;
        --stone: #17120c;
        --stone-2: #1f1811;
        --parch: #ecdfc2;
        --ink: #342610;
        --gold: #d4af37;
        --gold-lt: #f6e3a1;
        --gold-dk: #8a6a22;
        --blood: #a4271f;
        --text: #e9ddc4;
        --muted: #a99a7d;
        --line: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.34);
        --line-soft: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.16);
        --font-display: 'Cinzel Decorative', 'Times New Roman', serif;
        --font-head: 'Forum', 'Palatino Linotype', Georgia, serif;
        --font-body: 'PT Serif', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
        --gold-grad: linear-gradient(180deg, #fff6d8 8%, #eccb6b 48%, #a37c26 92%);
      }

      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        background: var(--night);
        color: var(--text);
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        font-size: 17px;
        line-height: 1.65;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }

      img {
        display: block;
        max-width: 100%;
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      h1, h2, h3 {
        font-weight: 400;
      }

      .shell {
        width: min(1140px, 100% - 40px);
        margin-inline: auto;
      }

      .gold-text {
        background: var(--gold-grad);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        background-clip: text;
        color: transparent;
      }

      /* ── шапка ──────────────────────────────────────── */
      .topbar {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 40;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(12, 9, 6, 0.96), rgba(12, 9, 6, 0.88));
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
        backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      }

      .topbar-inner {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 18px;
        padding: 10px 0;
      }

      .brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .brand svg {
        width: 34px;
        height: 40px;
        filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6));
      }

      .brand b {
        display: block;
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        line-height: 1.1;
      }

      .brand span {
        display: block;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.16em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .topnav {
        display: flex;
        gap: 4px;
        margin-left: auto;
      }

      .topnav a {
        padding: 8px 14px;
        border: 1px solid transparent;
        border-radius: 4px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-family: var(--font-head);
        font-size: 1rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        transition: color 0.16s ease, border-color 0.16s ease, background 0.16s ease;
      }

      .topnav a:hover,
      .topnav a:focus-visible {
        color: var(--gold-lt);
        border-color: var(--line-soft);
        background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.07);
      }

      .btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 9px;
        padding: 13px 26px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-family: var(--font-head);
        font-size: 1.02rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;
      }

      .btn-gold {
        color: #241905;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f3dd93, #d4af37 55%, #a37c26);
        border: 1px solid #6f5518;
        box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 249, 220, 0.8), 0 10px 24px -12px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.7);
      }

      .btn-gold:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 249, 220, 0.8), 0 16px 30px -12px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.8);
      }

      .btn-ghost {
        color: var(--gold-lt);
        background: rgba(12, 9, 6, 0.5);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .btn-ghost:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.1);
      }

      .btn-sm {
        padding: 9px 18px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }

      /* ── герой ──────────────────────────────────────── */
      .hero {
        position: relative;
        min-height: calc(100svh - 61px);
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        overflow: hidden;
        isolation: isolate;
      }

      .hero-bg {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        object-position: center 60%;
        z-index: -2;
        filter: saturate(1.05) contrast(1.04);
      }

      .hero::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: -1;
        background:
          radial-gradient(90% 70% at 50% 45%, rgba(12, 9, 6, 0.18), rgba(12, 9, 6, 0.72) 78%),
          linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(12, 9, 6, 0.86) 0%, rgba(12, 9, 6, 0.35) 38%, rgba(12, 9, 6, 0.55) 70%, var(--night) 100%);
      }

      .hero-frame {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 16px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.4);
        pointer-events: none;
      }

      .corner {
        position: absolute;
        width: 74px;
        height: 74px;
        color: var(--gold);
        opacity: 0.85;
        pointer-events: none;
      }

      .corner svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }

      .corner.tl { top: 4px; left: 4px; }
      .corner.tr { top: 4px; right: 4px; transform: scaleX(-1); }
      .corner.bl { bottom: 4px; left: 4px; transform: scaleY(-1); }
      .corner.br { bottom: 4px; right: 4px; transform: scale(-1, -1); }

      .hero-inner {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 90px 20px 110px;
        max-width: 880px;
      }

      .hero-eyebrow {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 14px;
        margin: 0 0 22px;
        color: var(--gold-lt);
        font-family: var(--font-head);
        font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 2vw, 1.05rem);
        letter-spacing: 0.42em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
      }

      .hero-eyebrow::before,
      .hero-eyebrow::after {
        content: '';
        width: clamp(30px, 8vw, 70px);
        height: 1px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--gold));
      }

      .hero-eyebrow::after {
        background: linear-gradient(270deg, transparent, var(--gold));
      }

      .hero h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: clamp(3rem, 13vw, 8rem);
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        line-height: 1;
        text-indent: 0.1em; /* компенсация letter-spacing по центру */
        background: var(--gold-grad);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        background-clip: text;
        color: transparent;
        filter: drop-shadow(0 6px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85));
      }

      .hero-sub {
        margin: 26px auto 0;
        max-width: 56ch;
        color: var(--text);
        font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.4vw, 1.2rem);
        text-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
      }

      .hero-motto {
        margin: 14px auto 0;
        color: var(--gold-lt);
        font-style: italic;
        font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 2vw, 1.08rem);
        text-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
      }

      .hero-cta {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 14px;
        margin-top: 36px;
      }

      .hero-strip {
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        bottom: 0;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 10px 34px;
        padding: 18px 20px 26px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-family: var(--font-head);
        font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 2vw, 1rem);
        letter-spacing: 0.24em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        text-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
      }

      .hero-strip span {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 34px;
      }

      .hero-strip span:not(:last-child)::after {
        content: '✦';
        color: var(--gold);
        font-size: 0.7em;
      }

      /* ── разделы: заголовок с орнаментом ────────────── */
      .sec-title {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 0 auto 42px;
      }

      .sec-title h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: var(--font-head);
        font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 4.4vw, 2.6rem);
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .sec-title .fleuron {
        display: block;
        width: min(320px, 70%);
        margin: 16px auto 0;
        color: var(--gold);
      }

      .sec-title p {
        margin: 14px auto 0;
        max-width: 60ch;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      /* ── приветствие на пергаменте ──────────────────── */
      .about {
        position: relative;
        padding: 84px 0 30px;
      }

      .parchment {
        position: relative;
        padding: clamp(30px, 5vw, 56px);
        color: var(--ink);
        background:
          radial-gradient(140% 100% at 15% 0%, rgba(255, 252, 240, 0.75), transparent 55%),
          radial-gradient(120% 90% at 90% 100%, rgba(150, 110, 45, 0.28), transparent 60%),
          linear-gradient(180deg, #f1e6cb 0%, #e6d6ae 60%, #ddc99b 100%);
        border: 2px solid #7d611f;
        outline: 1px solid var(--gold);
        outline-offset: 5px;
        box-shadow:
          inset 0 0 70px rgba(122, 88, 30, 0.35),
          inset 0 0 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18),
          0 40px 70px -40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
      }

      .parchment::after {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        inset: 10px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(125, 97, 31, 0.45);
        pointer-events: none;
      }

      .parchment h2 {
        margin: 0 0 6px;
        font-family: var(--font-head);
        font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.3rem);
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        color: #2c1f0c;
      }

      .parchment .kicker {
        margin: 0 0 20px;
        color: #8a6a22;
        font-family: var(--font-head);
        letter-spacing: 0.3em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
      }

      .parchment p {
        margin: 0 0 16px;
        font-size: 1.04rem;
      }

      .parchment p:last-of-type {
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }

      .parchment .drop::first-letter {
        float: left;
        margin: 6px 10px 0 0;
        font-family: var(--font-head);
        font-size: 3.4rem;
        line-height: 0.8;
        color: #8a6a22;
      }

      .chip-row {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-top: 26px;
      }

      .chip {
        padding: 7px 16px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(122, 88, 30, 0.55);
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(255, 250, 232, 0.55);
        color: #4a3616;
        font-family: var(--font-head);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      /* ── карточки ───────────────────────────────────── */
      .life {
        padding: 78px 0 40px;
      }

      .grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 24px;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        list-style: none;
      }

      .card {
        position: relative;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--stone-2), var(--stone));
        border: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
        border-radius: 8px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 26px 50px -34px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
        transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
      }

      .card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-6px);
        border-color: var(--line);
        box-shadow: 0 34px 60px -34px rgba(0, 0, 0, 1), 0 0 0 1px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.25);
      }

      .card-img {
        position: relative;
        aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .card-img img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        filter: saturate(0.92) brightness(0.92);
        transition: transform 0.5s ease;
      }

      .card:hover .card-img img {
        transform: scale(1.05);
      }

      .card-img::after {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(12, 9, 6, 0.05) 40%, rgba(12, 9, 6, 0.85) 100%);
      }

      .card-tag {
        position: absolute;
        left: 14px;
        bottom: 12px;
        z-index: 1;
        padding: 4px 12px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 4px;
        background: rgba(12, 9, 6, 0.75);
        color: var(--gold-lt);
        font-family: var(--font-head);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
      }

      .card-body {
        padding: 20px 22px 24px;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
      }

      .card-body h3 {
        margin: 0 0 8px;
        font-family: var(--font-head);
        font-size: 1.45rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      }

      .card-body p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.97rem;
      }

      /* ── набор ──────────────────────────────────────── */
      .recruit {
        position: relative;
        margin-top: 70px;
        isolation: isolate;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-block: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
      }

      .recruit-bg {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        object-position: center 55%;
        z-index: -2;
        filter: saturate(1.1);
      }

      .recruit::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: -1;
        background:
          radial-gradient(70% 90% at 50% 50%, rgba(120, 25, 12, 0.35), rgba(12, 9, 6, 0.88) 75%),
          linear-gradient(180deg, var(--night), rgba(12, 9, 6, 0.55) 30%, rgba(12, 9, 6, 0.55) 70%, var(--night));
      }

      .recruit-inner {
        padding: 74px 20px 78px;
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 760px;
        margin-inline: auto;
      }

      .recruit h2 {
        margin: 0 0 14px;
        font-family: var(--font-head);
        font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4.6vw, 2.8rem);
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .recruit p {
        margin: 0 auto;
        max-width: 54ch;
        color: var(--text);
        text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
      }

      .roles {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 12px;
        margin: 26px 0 30px;
      }

      .role {
        padding: 9px 22px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 4px;
        background: rgba(12, 9, 6, 0.62);
        color: var(--gold-lt);
        font-family: var(--font-head);
        font-size: 1.02rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      /* ── подвал ─────────────────────────────────────── */
      footer {
        padding: 46px 0 40px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.88rem;
      }

      .foot-grid {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 18px 40px;
        padding-bottom: 24px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
      }

      .foot-brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .foot-brand svg {
        width: 30px;
        height: 35px;
      }

      .foot-brand b {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        font-size: 1rem;
      }

      .foot-links {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 8px 24px;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .foot-links a {
        font-family: var(--font-head);
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-size: 0.92rem;
      }

      .foot-links a:hover {
        color: var(--gold-lt);
      }

      .foot-note {
        margin: 20px 0 0;
        max-width: 76ch;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .foot-note a {
        color: var(--gold);
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-underline-offset: 3px;
      }

      /* ── адаптив ────────────────────────────────────── */
      @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .topnav {
          display: none;
        }
        .grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
        .hero-frame {
          inset: 10px;
        }
        .corner {
          width: 52px;
          height: 52px;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 560px) {
        body {
          font-size: 16px;
        }
        .topbar .btn {
          display: none;
        }
        .hero-inner {
          padding: 70px 4px 130px;
        }
        .hero-strip {
          gap: 6px 16px;
          letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        }
        .hero-strip span {
          gap: 16px;
        }
        .parchment {
          outline-offset: 3px;
        }
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        html {
          scroll-behavior: auto;
        }
        *,
        *::before,
        *::after {
          transition: none !important;
          animation: none !important;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <!-- ══ шапка ══ -->
    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="shell topbar-inner">
        <a class="brand" href={base} aria-label="Гильдия Durotar — на главную">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 56" aria-hidden="true">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="crestG" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
                <stop offset="0" stop-color="#f3dd93" />
                <stop offset="0.5" stop-color="#d4af37" />
                <stop offset="1" stop-color="#8a6a22" />
              </linearGradient>
            </defs>
            <path
              d="M24 2 44 9v17c0 14-8.6 23.4-20 28C12.6 49.4 4 40 4 26V9Z"
              fill="#7e1a15"
              stroke="url(#crestG)"
              stroke-width="3"
            />
            <path
              d="M24 7 39 12v14c0 11-6.6 18.6-15 22.4C15.6 44.6 9 37 9 26V12Z"
              fill="none"
              stroke="url(#crestG)"
              stroke-width="1.2"
              opacity="0.75"
            />
            <text
              x="24"
              y="36"
              text-anchor="middle"
              font-family="Cinzel Decorative, serif"
              font-size="24"
              font-weight="700"
              fill="url(#crestG)">D</text
            >
          </svg>
          <span>
            <b class="gold-text">DUROTAR</b>
            <span>гильдия · WoW: Forever</span>
          </span>
        </a>

        <nav class="topnav" aria-label="Основная навигация">
          {nav.map((item) => <a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a>)}
        </nav>

        <a class="btn btn-gold btn-sm" href="#recruit">В гильдию</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- ══ герой ══ -->
    <section class="hero" aria-label="Приветствие">
      <img
        class="hero-bg"
        src={commons(hero.dir, hero.name, 1920)}
        srcset={`${commons(hero.dir, hero.name, 960)} 960w, ${commons(hero.dir, hero.name, 1920)} 1920w`}
        sizes="100vw"
        alt={hero.alt}
        fetchpriority="high"
        decoding="async"
      />

      <div class="hero-frame" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="corner tl">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 74 74" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6">
            <path d="M2 72V22C2 11 11 2 22 2h50" />
            <path d="M10 72V26c0-9 7-16 16-16h46" opacity="0.5" />
            <path d="M14 34c0-11 9-20 20-20" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.8" />
            <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="3" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="corner tr">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 74 74" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6">
            <path d="M2 72V22C2 11 11 2 22 2h50" />
            <path d="M10 72V26c0-9 7-16 16-16h46" opacity="0.5" />
            <path d="M14 34c0-11 9-20 20-20" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.8" />
            <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="3" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="corner bl">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 74 74" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6">
            <path d="M2 72V22C2 11 11 2 22 2h50" />
            <path d="M10 72V26c0-9 7-16 16-16h46" opacity="0.5" />
            <path d="M14 34c0-11 9-20 20-20" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.8" />
            <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="3" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="corner br">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 74 74" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6">
            <path d="M2 72V22C2 11 11 2 22 2h50" />
            <path d="M10 72V26c0-9 7-16 16-16h46" opacity="0.5" />
            <path d="M14 34c0-11 9-20 20-20" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.8" />
            <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="3" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
          </svg>
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-inner">
        <p class="hero-eyebrow">Добро пожаловать</p>
        <h1>DUROTAR</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">
          Русскоязычная гильдия в мире <strong>World of Warcraft: Forever</strong>: классические
          рейды, подземелья, PvP и люди, с которыми хочется возвращаться в игру.
        </p>
        <p class="hero-motto">«Все большие приключения начинаются в Дуратаре»</p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a class="btn btn-gold" href="#recruit">Вступить в гильдию</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#about">О гильдии</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-strip" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>Рейды</span>
        <span>Подземелья</span>
        <span>PvP</span>
        <span>Дружба</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ══ приветствие ══ -->
    <section class="about" id="about">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="parchment">
          <p class="kicker">Приветствие</p>
          <h2>Рады видеть тебя!</h2>
          <p class="drop">
            Мы — гильдия Durotar, русскоязычное сообщество игроков в World of Warcraft: Forever —
            последней версии на основе Classic: уровни с 1 по 60, девять классов, знакомые
            подземелья и рейды плюс новые таланты, заклинания и зоны. Наша цель — получать от
            игры удовольствие вместе, а не в одиночку фармить впустую.
          </p>
          <p>
            У нас проходят вечерние рейды, подземелья, бг и просто разговоры в Discord. Неважно,
            новичок ты или ветеран со стажем — за нашим столом всегда найдется место.
          </p>
          <p>
            Сайт только начинает расти: приветственная страница уже готова, а дальше появятся
            разделы со составом, расписанием и правилами гильдии.
          </p>
          <div class="chip-row">
            <span class="chip">WoW: Forever</span>
            <span class="chip">Уровни 1–60</span>
            <span class="chip">35 подземелий</span>
            <span class="chip">Открытый набор</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ══ чем живём ══ -->
    <section class="life" id="life">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="sec-title">
          <h2 class="gold-text">Чем живёт гильдия</h2>
          <svg class="fleuron" viewBox="0 0 320 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M0 12h110" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.7" />
            <path d="M210 12h110" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.7" />
            <path d="M160 4c-14 0-22 4-30 8 8 4 16 8 30 8s22-4 30-8c-8-4-16-8-30-8z" stroke-width="1.4" />
            <circle cx="160" cy="12" r="3" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
            <path d="M124 12c8-6 14-8 20-8M196 12c-8-6-14-8-20-8" stroke-width="1.1" opacity="0.8" />
            <path d="M124 12c8 6 14 8 20 8M196 12c-8 6-14 8-20 8" stroke-width="1.1" opacity="0.8" />
          </svg>
          <p>Четыре столпа, на которых держится наша неделя.</p>
        </div>

        <ul class="grid">
          {
            cards.map((c) => (
              <li class="card">
                <div class="card-img">
                  <img
                    src={commons(c.dir, c.name, 960)}
                    srcset={`${commons(c.dir, c.name, 960)} 960w, ${commons(c.dir, c.name, 1920)} 1920w`}
                    sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 50vw"
                    alt={c.alt}
                    loading="lazy"
                    decoding="async"
                  />
                  <span class="card-tag">{c.tag}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                  <h3>{c.title}</h3>
                  <p>{c.text}</p>
                </div>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ══ новое: секции ══ -->
    <style>
      .patch-bar{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:26px auto 0;padding:12px 20px;width:fit-content;max-width:92%;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;background:rgba(212,175,55,.07);font-family:var(--font-head);letter-spacing:.04em}
      .patch-bar b{color:var(--gold-lt)}
      .patch-bar a{color:var(--gold);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
      .s-pad{padding:78px 0 40px}
      .class-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:14px;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}
      .cls{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:18px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line-soft);border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--stone-2),var(--stone));text-align:center;transition:transform .18s ease,border-color .18s ease}
      .cls:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:var(--line)}
      .cls .med{width:52px;height:52px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--c);background:radial-gradient(circle at 32% 28%,rgba(255,255,255,.22),rgba(0,0,0,.55));color:var(--c);font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.3rem;box-shadow:0 0 14px -4px var(--c)}
      .cls b{font-family:var(--font-head);font-size:1.02rem;letter-spacing:.04em}
      .cls span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem}
      .gal{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}
      .gal a{position:relative;display:block;border:1px solid var(--line-soft);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:4/3}
      .gal img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;filter:saturate(.95) brightness(.9);transition:transform .45s ease,filter .3s ease}
      .gal a:hover img{transform:scale(1.06);filter:saturate(1.05) brightness(1)}
      .quotes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}
      .quote{padding:22px;border:1px solid var(--line-soft);border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(236,223,194,.06),rgba(0,0,0,.25));font-style:italic;color:var(--text)}
      .quote p{margin:0 0 14px}
      .quote .who{font-style:normal;font-family:var(--font-head);letter-spacing:.06em}
      .quote .who b{color:var(--qc)}
      .quote .who span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem}
      .steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin:30px 0 34px;counter-reset:st}
      .step-n{padding:22px 18px;border:1px solid var(--line-soft);border-radius:10px;background:var(--stone);text-align:center}
      .step-n::before{counter-increment:st;content:counter(st);display:grid;place-items:center;width:40px;height:40px;margin:0 auto 12px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--gold);color:var(--gold-lt);font-family:var(--font-display);background:rgba(212,175,55,.08)}
      .step-n b{display:block;font-family:var(--font-head);letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:6px}
      .step-n span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem}
      @media(max-width:820px){.gal,.quotes,.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
      @media(max-width:540px){.gal,.quotes,.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
    </style>

    <div class="patch-bar">
      <b>{patch.title}</b>
      <span>— {patch.note}</span>
      <a href={patch.link} rel="noopener">список изменений →</a>
    </div>

    <section class="s-pad" id="classes">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="sec-title">
          <h2 class="gold-text">Классы Forever</h2>
          <p>В наборе все девять классов Classic — берём любые роли.</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="class-grid">
          {
            classes.map((c) => (
              <li class="cls" style={`--c:${c.color}`}>
                <span class="med">{c.letter}</span>
                <b>{c.name}</b>
                <span>{c.roles}</span>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="s-pad" id="gallery">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="sec-title">
          <h2 class="gold-text">Краски Азерота</h2>
          <p>Настроение мира, пока здесь временные картинки — присылай свои скриншоты, заменим.</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="gal">
          {
            gallery.map((g) => (
              <li>
                <a href={commons(g.dir, g.name, 1920)} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                  <img src={commons(g.dir, g.name, 960)} alt={g.alt} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                </a>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="s-pad" id="quotes">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="sec-title">
          <h2 class="gold-text">Голоса гильдии</h2>
          <p>Пока — заглушки: придут настоящие цитаты гильдейцев.</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="quotes">
          {
            quotes.map((q) => (
              <li class="quote" style={`--qc:${q.color}`}>
                <p>«{q.text}»</p>
                <div class="who">
                  <b>{q.nick}</b> <span>· {q.cls}</span>
                </div>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="s-pad" id="join">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="sec-title">
          <h2 class="gold-text">Новичку: как вступить</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="steps">
          <div class="step-n"><b>Шаг 1</b><span>Напиши нам и зайди в Discord гильдии.</span></div>
          <div class="step-n"><b>Шаг 2</b><span>Заполни короткую анкету: класс, опыт, удобное время.</span></div>
          <div class="step-n"><b>Шаг 3</b><span>Получи инвайт в игру и присоединяйся к вылазкам.</span></div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:center">
          <a class="btn btn-gold" href="#recruit">Написать нам</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ══ набор ══ -->
    <section class="recruit" id="recruit">
      <img
        class="recruit-bg"
        src={commons(lava.dir, lava.name, 1920)}
        alt={lava.alt}
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
      <div class="recruit-inner">
        <div class="sec-title" style="margin-bottom: 0">
          <h2 class="gold-text">Нам нужны герои</h2>
          <svg class="fleuron" viewBox="0 0 320 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M0 12h110" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.7" />
            <path d="M210 12h110" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.7" />
            <path d="M160 4c-14 0-22 4-30 8 8 4 16 8 30 8s22-4 30-8c-8-4-16-8-30-8z" stroke-width="1.4" />
            <circle cx="160" cy="12" r="3" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
            <path d="M124 12c8-6 14-8 20-8M196 12c-8-6-14-8-20-8" stroke-width="1.1" opacity="0.8" />
            <path d="M124 12c8 6 14 8 20 8M196 12c-8 6-14 8-20 8" stroke-width="1.1" opacity="0.8" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p>
          Открытый набор в гильдию. Ищем танков, хилов и дд — и просто хороших людей, которым
          важно, с кем они играют. Присоединяйся: познакомимся и покажем, как всё устроено.
        </p>
        <div class="roles">
          {roles.map((r) => <span class="role">{r}</span>)}
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn-gold" href="#contacts">Написать нам</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ══ подвал ══ -->
    <footer id="contacts">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="foot-grid">
          <div class="foot-brand">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 56" aria-hidden="true">
              <defs>
                <linearGradient id="crestF" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
                  <stop offset="0" stop-color="#f3dd93" />
                  <stop offset="0.5" stop-color="#d4af37" />
                  <stop offset="1" stop-color="#8a6a22" />
                </linearGradient>
              </defs>
              <path
                d="M24 2 44 9v17c0 14-8.6 23.4-20 28C12.6 49.4 4 40 4 26V9Z"
                fill="#7e1a15"
                stroke="url(#crestF)"
                stroke-width="3"
              />
              <text
                x="24"
                y="36"
                text-anchor="middle"
                font-family="Cinzel Decorative, serif"
                font-size="24"
                font-weight="700"
                fill="url(#crestF)">D</text
              >
            </svg>
            <div>
              <b>DUROTAR</b><br />
              <span>гильдия World of Warcraft: Forever</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <nav class="foot-links" aria-label="Ссылки подвала">
            <a href="#about">О нас</a>
            <a href="#life">Чем живём</a>
            <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}cities/`}>Города</a>
            <a href="#recruit">Набор</a>
            <a href="#recruit">Discord</a>
          </nav>
        </div>

        <p class="foot-note">
          © {new Date().getFullYear()} Гильдия Durotar. Сайт посвящён игре World of Warcraft:
          Forever; World of Warcraft и Warcraft® — товарные знаки Blizzard Entertainment.
          Проект любительский и не связан с Blizzard. Фотографии: <a
            href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/"
            rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
